"Machine Learning (ML) – Introduction
Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence (AI) ki ek important branch hai. Ismein hum computer ko data se patterns seekhna sikhate hain, taake woh naye data par predictions ya decisions kar sake.

Simple words mein:

Traditional Programming: Hum computer ko rules dete hain aur woh un rules ke mutabiq output deta hai.

Machine Learning: Hum computer ko data aur correct examples dete hain, aur algorithm unmein patterns learn karta hai.
1. AI vs ML vs DL
In teen terms ko samajhna bohat important hai.
Artificial Intelligence (AI)

Machines performing intelligent tasks

Machine Learning (ML)

Learning patterns from data

Deep Learning (DL)

Learning using neural networks


Deep Learning, Machine Learning ka subset hai aur Machine Learning, AI ka subset hai.